---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy — WoW Forever Talent Calculator"
  description="Privacy notes for this site: builds are stored in your browser's local storage, share links contain no personal fields, there are no accounts, and no third-party analytics are currently enabled."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
    { name: 'Privacy', url: '/privacy/' },
  ]}
>
  <section class="page-head">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      This site is a static tool with no accounts and no server-side storage
      of your builds. This page explains exactly what is stored, where, and
      what a share link contains.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section prose" aria-labelledby="local-storage">
    <h2 id="local-storage">Local storage</h2>
    <p>
      Saved builds and your current draft are kept in your browser's
      <code>localStorage</code> on your own device. They are never uploaded.
      Clearing your browser data or switching devices removes them; the site
      has no way to recover them for you. If storage is unavailable (private
      modes, disabled storage), you can still build and copy a share link.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section prose" aria-labelledby="share-links">
    <h2 id="share-links">What share links contain</h2>
    <p>
      A share link encodes only the build itself: class, level, point
      allocation, ruleset, and the data snapshot ID. It contains no name,
      email, account identifier, or any other personal field. Anyone you send
      the link to sees exactly the talent setup and nothing about you.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section prose" aria-labelledby="accounts">
    <h2 id="accounts">Accounts</h2>
    <p>
      There is no sign-up, no login, and no user database.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section prose" aria-labelledby="analytics">
    <h2 id="analytics">Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      This site uses Google Analytics 4 to collect anonymous, aggregated usage
      data — page views, referrers, approximate location (country/city), and
      device/browser type — so we can see which tools and pages need work.
      GA4 does not receive names, emails, or any account information: there is
      no sign-up and nothing you type into the calculator is transmitted. IP
      addresses are anonymized at collection. No advertising trackers are
      used, and GA4 data is not used for ad personalization. You can opt out
      with
      <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="external"
        >Google's official opt-out browser add-on</a
      >, or block <code>googletagmanager.com</code> with any content blocker.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section prose" aria-labelledby="cookies">
    <h2 id="cookies">Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      The site itself does not set tracking cookies. It is served as static
      files; the hosting provider may process standard connection logs
      (IP address, user agent) for security and delivery purposes under its
      own policies.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section prose">
    <p>
      Questions about this policy? See the contact details on the
      {' '}<a href="/about/">About</a> page.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
